#: src/konqtabs.cpp:66
msgid ""
"This bar contains the list of currently open tabs. Click on a tab to make it "
"active. You can also use keyboard shortcuts to navigate through tabs. The "
"text on the tab shows the content currently open in it; place your mouse "
"over the tab to see the full title, in case it has been shortened to fit the "
"tab width."
msgstr ""
"Hetaja panel źmiaščaje śpis adčynienych kartak. Kab pieraklučyć u peŭnuju "
"kartku, klikni ŭ jaje. Ty možaš pieraklučać kartki klavijaturnymi skarotami. "
"Tekst na kartcy aznačaje jejnaje źmieściva. Kab ubačyć poŭnuju nazvu, "
"źmiaści kursor myšy na patrebnaj kartcy."

