#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:143
msgid ""
"Konqueror makes working with and managing your files easy. You can browse "
"both local and networked folders while enjoying advanced features such as "
"the powerful sidebar and file previews."
msgstr ""
"Prahrama „Konqueror” robić kiravańnie fajłami prostaj spravaj. Ty možaš "
"prahladać miascovyja j sietkavyja katalohi. U prahramy šmat raznastajnych "
"zručnaściaŭ, naprykład, bakavaja panel i padhlady fajłaŭ."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:147
msgid ""
"Konqueror is also a full featured and easy to use web browser which you can "
"use to explore the Internet. Enter the address (e.g. <a href=\"http://www."
"kde.org\">http://www.kde.org</a>) of a web page you would like to visit in "
"the location bar and press Enter, or choose an entry from the Bookmarks menu."
msgstr ""
"Prahrama „Konqueror” taksama jość zdolnym i zručnym hartačom sieciva, ź "
"jakim ty možaš prahladać sieciva. Prosta ŭpišy ŭ paneli adras (naprykład, <a "
"href=\"http://www.kde.org\">http://www.kde.org</a>) sieciŭnaj staronki i "
"naciśni klavišu „Enter”, albo vybiery jakuju-niebudź zakładku z adpaviednaha "
"menu."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:152
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"To return to the previous location, press the back button <img width='16' "
"height='16' src=\"%1\"></img> in the toolbar. "
msgstr ""
"Kab viarnucca na minułaje miesca, klikni ŭ knopku „Nazad” <img width='16' "
"height='16' src=\"%1\"></img> na paneli pryładździa. "

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:155
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"To quickly go to your Home folder press the  home button <img width='16' "
"height='16' src=\"%1\"></img>."
msgstr ""
"Kab viarnucca ŭ chatni kataloh, klikni ŭ knopku „Dadomu” <img width='16' "
"height='16' src=\"%1\"></img>. "

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:157
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"For more detailed documentation on Konqueror click <a href=\"%1\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kab pračytać padrabiaznuju dakumentacyju pra „Konqueror”, klikni <a href=\"%1"
"\">siudy</a>."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:159
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<em>Tuning Tip:</em> If you want the Konqueror web browser to start faster, "
"you can turn off this information screen by clicking <a href=\"%1\">here</"
"a>. You can re-enable it by choosing the Help -> Konqueror Introduction menu "
"option, and then pressing Settings -> Save View Profile \"Web Browsing\"."
msgstr ""
"<em>Parada:</em> Kali ty chočaš, kab hartač sieciva „Konqueror” uklučaŭsia "
"chutčej, vyklučy hety infarmacyjny ekran, kliknuŭšy <a href=\"%1\">siudy</"
"a>. Ty možaš jaho znoŭ uklučyć praz menu: Dapamoha → Uvodziny ŭ prahramu "
"„Konqueror”, i tam kliknuŭšy: Nałady → Zapišy profil prahladu „Prahlad "
"sieciva”."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:164
msgid "Next: Tips &amp; Tricks"
msgstr "Dalej: Parady j padkazki"

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:198
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Konqueror is designed to embrace and support Internet standards. The aim is "
"to fully implement the officially sanctioned standards from organizations "
"such as the W3 and OASIS, while also adding extra support for other common "
"usability features that arise as de facto standards across the Internet. "
"Along with this support, for such functions as favicons, Internet Keywords, "
"and <A HREF=\"%1\">XBEL bookmarks</A>, Konqueror also implements:"
msgstr ""
"Hartač „Konqueror” sprajektavany z dumkaj pra standarty sieciva. Našaj "
"metaju jość poŭnaja ŭzhodnienaść z aficyjna dazvolenymi standartami ad "
"pavažnych arhanizacyjaŭ, naprykład, ad „W3” i „OASIS”, a taksama ŭsprymańnie "
"inšych paŭsiudnych mahčymaściaŭ, jakija stali zvykłymi ŭ siecivie. Akramia "
"hetaha, hartač „Konqueror” absłuhoŭvaje ikony sajtaŭ, klučavyja słovy, <A "
"HREF=\"%1\">zakładki „XBEL”</A> dy inšyja funkcyi, naprykład:"

